# Glossary:
#   Session            sesjon (always, never «økt»)
#   Record (mode)      opptak (tooltip on the button: «Ta opp»)
#   Playback (mode)    avspilling
#   Recording          opptak
#   Track              spor
#   Test step          testtrinn
#   Viewport           synsfelt
#   Gaze cursor        blikk-peker
#   Caption            bildetekst
#   Creator            opphaver
#   Contributor        bidragsyter
#   Microphone         mikrofon
#   Speaker (device)   høyttaler
#   Speaker (talker)   taler
#   Listening device   lytteenhet
#   Mute / muted       demp / dempet
#   Assign             tilordne
#   Connected          tilkoblet
#   Disconnected       frakoblet
#   Participant        deltaker
#   Ambient            ambient (Ambient mikrofon, Ambient høyttaler)
#   Monitoring         medhør (monitoring matrix: medhørsmatrise)
#   Prod               prod, a technical term (fagord) for probing (en prod, proden, proder; å prodde)
#   Head-prod          hodeprod
#   Fixation time      fikseringstid (pointer: for peker; gaze: for blikk)
#   Voice levelling    stemmejustering
#   ADSR terms         attack, decay, sustain, release — technical terms, kept as is (sustain-nivå, sustain-fasen)
#   Diarization        diarisering (diarize: diarisere)
#   Alignment model    alignment-modell (technical term; gives each word its timestamp)
#   Bigram             bigram, pl. bigrammer (technical term; the two-letter label in the matrix)
#   Model names        not translated (Small, Medium, Large-v3, Base, Large)
#   Synthesized        syntetisert
#   Gain               forsterkning
#   Latency / delay    forsinkelse
#   Transcode          omkode
#   Depth map          dybdekart
#   Fiducial marker    referansemarkør
#   Preferences        innstillinger
#
# Quotes are «», and dialog-opening labels end in "…" with no space.
#
